  dialogs:
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Welcome back, Founder. Are you ready to begin?
  - name: Founder
    dialog: Yes.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Good. Your first task awaits.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Task Issue #224 — create the visual assets for our game.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Every asset must be crafted by our own hands.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Stock assets are the language of the mediocre. We do not speak it.
  - name: Perfectionism
    dialog: Do not worry. With me guiding you, mediocrity is not an option.
